Switch attempt: POST /api/v1/employees/32f38afa-06a7-4d6e-b56b-a5370654cffb/tax-scheme-elections {"tax_scheme_id":"d988e8a3-acde-4b86-ace1-39ca692a5d34"} -> 500 {"detail":"Internal server error"}

GET /api/v1/employees/32f38afa-06a7-4d6e-b56b-a5370654cffb/tax-scheme-elections -> 200, still only [{"scheme_name_snapshot":"ZZTest Scheme A2","superseded_at":null}] â€” nothing changed. Re-electing the SAME scheme also -> 500. The scheme's choice_window is ANY_TIME, so the endpoint's own 409 guard ("only allows one election per Financial Year") deliberately does not apply here.

First call: POST /api/v1/employees/32f38afa-06a7-4d6e-b56b-a5370654cffb/tax-declarations -> 201 {"id":"2cd4f0ad-8ecb-43d2-8010-19a313907326","status":"DRAFT",...}

